    "Higher supersampling renders glyphs above final resolution, then downsamples them for cleaner tiny shapes.": "Rindreálann forshampláil níos airde glifí os cionn an taifigh deiridh agus laghdaíonn sé iad ansin le haghaidh cruthanna beaga níos glaine.",
    "Transparent ASCII background keeps alpha in transparency-capable exports.": "Coinníonn cúlra trédhearcach ASCII alfa in easpórtálacha a thacaíonn le trédhearcacht.",
    "Adds unique characters to the selected built-in set without replacing it.": "Cuireann sé carachtair uathúla leis an tacar ionsuite roghnaithe gan é a athsholáthar.",
    "Glyph size relative to the cell. 1.00× is roughly one cell high; the cell grid and spacing do not change.": "Méid an ghleif i gcoibhneas leis an gcill. Tá 1.00× thart ar chill amháin ar airde; ní athraíonn greille ná spásáil na gceall.",
    "How strongly High Detail cares about the spatial shape inside each cell.": "Cé chomh láidir is a chuireann Ardsonra san áireamh an cruth spásúil laistigh de gach cill.",
    "Keeps the chosen glyph's overall ink/brightness density close to the source cell.": "Coinníonn sé dlús foriomlán dúigh/gile an ghleif roghnaithe gar don chill foinse.",
    "Boosts contrast inside each cell before shape matching so edges survive in shadows and highlights.": "Méadaíonn sé codarsnacht laistigh de gach cill roimh mheaitseáil crutha ionas go mairfidh imill i scáthanna agus buaicphointí.",
