    "s": "s",
    "The slider covers 0–60 seconds. Type a value up to 300 seconds for longer retention.": "Clúdaíonn an sleamhnán 0–60 soicind. Cuir luach suas le 300 soicind isteach le haghaidh marthanachta níos faide.",
    "Temporal history accumulates during forward playback, rendered animation/video previews, and sequential exports. After seeking or changing persistence settings, re-render the preview to rebuild history.": "Cruinníonn stair ama le linn athsheinm ar aghaidh, réamhamhairc rindreáilte beochana/físe agus easpórtálacha seicheamhacha. Tar éis cuardaigh nó athrú marthanachta, rindreáil an réamhamharc arís chun an stair a atógáil.",
    "CRT keeps bright phosphor trails, with green lingering slightly longer than red and blue.": "Coinníonn CRT lorg geal fosfair, agus maireann glas beagán níos faide ná dearg agus gorm.",
    "LCD models pixel-response lag, with darker transitions typically trailing longer.": "Samhlaíonn LCD moill freagartha picteilíní; de ghnáth fágann aistrithe níos dorcha lorg níos faide.",
    "OLED models longer temporary retention concentrated in bright image regions.": "Samhlaíonn OLED marthanacht shealadach níos faide atá dírithe ar réigiúin gheala na híomhá.",
    "Generic blends a neutral exponential history of previous frame colours.": "Cumascann Ginearálta stair easpónantúil neodrach de dhathanna na bhfrámaí roimhe seo.",
